{"data": {"notes": [], "reqs": [{"kind": "contract", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R1", "source": {"type": "task_metadata"}, "status": "active", "text": "Entry point `solve` in language python, within the stated limits.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R2", "source": {"char_end": 1303, "char_start": 0, "quote": "You are an expert Python programmer. You will be given a question (problem specification) and will generate a correct Python program that matches the specification and passes all tests.\n\n### Question:\nGiven a string s, calculate its reverse degree.\nThe reverse degree is calculated as follows:\n\nFor each character, multiply its position in the reversed alphabet ('a' = 26, 'b' = 25, ..., 'z' = 1) with its position in the string (1-indexed).\nSum these products for all characters in the string.\n\nReturn the reverse degree of s.\n \nExample 1:\n\nInput: s = \"abc\"\nOutput: 148\nExplanation:\n\n\n\nLetter\nIndex in Reversed Alphabet\nIndex in String\nProduct\n\n\n'a'\n26\n1\n26\n\n\n'b'\n25\n2\n50\n\n\n'c'\n24\n3\n72\n\n\n\nThe reversed degree is 26 + 50 + 72 = 148.\n\nExample 2:\n\nInput: s = \"zaza\"\nOutput: 160\nExplanation:\n\n\n\nLetter\nIndex in Reversed Alphabet\nIndex in String\nProduct\n\n\n'z'\n1\n1\n1\n\n\n'a'\n26\n2\n52\n\n\n'z'\n1\n3\n3\n\n\n'a'\n26\n4\n104\n\n\n\nThe reverse degree is 1 + 52 + 3 + 104 = 160.\n\n \nConstraints:\n\n1 <= s.length <= 1000\ns contains only lowercase English letters.\n\n### Format: You will use the following starter code to write the solution to the problem and enclose your code within delimiters.\n```python\nclass Solution:\n    def reverseDegree(self, s: str) -> int:\n        \n```\n\n### Answer: (use the provided format with backticks)\n\n", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 1339, "char_start": 1315, "quote": "Input:\n\"abc\"\nOutput:\n148", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 1376, "char_start": 1351, "quote": "Input:\n\"zaza\"\nOutput:\n160", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}], "request_sha": "9eb06c3e17c822b3627ae3ef78c7c91349671d8d9018b6e54ae6b9ba927b217d", "stop": null}, "kind": "requirements", "prev": "bcd297b76962a9a65373ca4d0c684468936f567fd2a43a17b873ce9725cb5c15", "seq": 2}
